BT /F1 9 Tf 54.0 313.0 Td (  - Updated in real-time as claims are adjudicated) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54.0 299.0 Td (  - Member portal display is sourced from Facets) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 42.0 277.0 Td (Secondary system: Cognos BI reporting \(accumulator_report extract\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54.0 262.0 Td (  - Refreshed nightly via batch extract from Facets) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54.0 248.0 Td (  - Used for audit reporting and regulatory filings) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54.0 234.0 Td (  - Lag of up to 24 hours versus Facets real-time balance) Tj ET
