42.0 191.0 m 570.0 191.0 l S
BT /F1 10 Tf 42.0 181.0 Td (The following scenarios can cause Cognos to differ from Facets:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.0 158.0 Td (Scenario A - Adjusted Claims:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 66.0 143.0 Td (Claim adjusted after nightly Cognos extract runs. Facets is correct;) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 66.0 129.0 Td (Cognos will reconcile on next nightly run.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.0 107.0 Td (Scenario B - Reversed Claims:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 66.0 92.0 Td (Claim reversal processed same day as Cognos extract. Accumulator may be) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 66.0 78.0 Td (double-counted in Cognos until next reconciliation cycle.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.0 56.0 Td (Scenario C - Coordination of Benefits \(COB\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 66.0 41.0 Td (COB adjustments may reduce accumulated amounts retroactively.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 66.0 27.0 Td (Facets applies COB in real time; Cognos may show pre-COB balance.) Tj ET
