BT /F2 12 Tf 42.0 682.0 Td (5. ACCUMULATOR AUDIT PROCESS) Tj ET
42.0 661.0 m 570.0 661.0 l S
BT /F1 10 Tf 42.0 651.0 Td (The high-dollar claims audit pipeline flags members where:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54.0 636.0 Td (abs\(facets_accumulated - cognos_accumulated\) / facets_accumulated > 0.05  \(>5% variance\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54.0 622.0 Td (OR facets_accumulated > oop_max_individual * 0.90  \(within 10% of OOP cap\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 42.0 600.0 Td (Auditor workflow for each flagged member:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.0 585.0 Td (Step 1: Review claim_history for 90-day window \(use service_from_date\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.0 570.0 Td (Step 2: Confirm claim_type filter: professional + institutional \(exclude pharmacy\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.0 555.0 Td (Step 3: Compare line-level allowed amounts to Cognos report rows) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.0 540.0 Td (Step 4: If discrepancy > $100, escalate to Claims Adjustment team) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.0 525.0 Td (Step 5: Document finding in audit_decisions table with evidence record) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 42.0 502.0 Td (6. 90-DAY LOOKBACK WINDOW DEFINITION) Tj ET
42.0 481.0 m 570.0 481.0 l S
BT /F1 10 Tf 42.0 471.0 Td (The 90-day lookback for accumulator validation uses SERVICE_FROM_DATE,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 42.0 456.0 Td (not paid_date or processed_date. This is the regulatory requirement.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.0 433.0 Td (Date edge cases:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 66.0 418.0 Td (If service spans multiple calendar years, split accumulation by plan year) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 66.0 404.0 Td (COB primary/secondary must be applied before accumulator comparison) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 66.0 390.0 Td (Late charges \(billed > 90 days post-service\) count toward service year) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 42.0 368.0 Td (7. WRITE-BACK AUTHORIZATION) Tj ET
42.0 347.0 m 570.0 347.0 l S
BT /F1 10 Tf 42.0 337.0 Td (Accumulator corrections in Facets require:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.0 322.0 Td (Supervisor approval for corrections > $500) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.0 307.0 Td (Medical Director approval for corrections > $5,000) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.0 292.0 Td (Regulatory filing for corrections affecting MLR calculation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 42.0 269.0 Td (Automated correction via the AI audit pipeline is NOT permitted.) Tj ET
